# Mole's optimize whitelist, linked to ~/.config/mole/whitelist_optimize by
# mise (conf.d/40-dotfiles.toml). A Mac can link its own list: docs/mole.md.
# One task id per line, exact match.
#
# Empty on purpose: every task runs. Two of them delete history, which favors
# privacy, so they stay on. To keep that history on one Mac, list either id in
# its .local:
#   coreduet_cleanup     usage data (knowledgeC.db) older than 90 days
#   quarantine_cleanup   the "downloaded from the internet" history
